<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS MAY 28/29.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS MAY 28/29.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for May 28/29. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German mark.</p>
<p>	   May 28/29	 May 27/28</p>
<p> CZK	0.41267	  0.41205</p>
<p> DKK	2.10009	  2.10083</p>
<p> FIM	2.65351	  2.65453</p>
<p> HUF	0.07468	  0.07467</p>
<p> JPY	0.11752	  0.11679</p>
<p> LTL	3.40719	  3.39079</p>
<p> LVL     23.9011	  23.86768</p>
<p> RUR	0.00236	  0.00236</p>
<p> SEK	1.77873	  1.77964</p>
<p> UAH	7.3307	   7.30819</p>
<p> USD     13.6296	  13.564</p>
<p> XEU     15.59567	 15.59114</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
